# Camera service: owns its own subtree (correct).
user svc_cam
topic readwrite cam/frontdoor/#

# Monitoring service meant to read health only
# cam/frontdoor/config to any valid monitoring credential.
user svc_health
topic read cam/#
topic read $SYS/#

# Home Assistant user
# Also over-broad on cam (read cam/#) in this scenario.
user svc_ha
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite home/lab/#
topic read cam/#
